engine/godot/issues/comments/3085271561","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108598#issuecomment-3085271561","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108598","id":3085271561,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc635YIJ","user":{"login":"CreatedBySeb","id":11736217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzM2MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11736217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb","html_url":"https://github.com/CreatedBySeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-17T19:45:39Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T19:46:36Z","body":"Could not reproduce on `v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]` on macOS on a different project. Are you able to reproduce this with a cleaner MRP lacking addons?\n\nI also notice that your `Ass/items/` folder has its own `.godot` directory which I don't believe is intended, only the project root is meant to have a `.godot` directory. It also has `.gitignore`, `.gitattributes` and `.editorconfig` which also all typically live at the project root. Does the issue still recur with these things removed?\n\nThe specific issue you describe also sounds a lot like bad handling of a recursive symlink, but inspecting your provided project shows the `Ass/items/.gitignore` file as a normal file rather than a symlink. Is it also a normal file on your system?\n\nIt is also possible potentially that the image files being dropped have an issue affecting it, so can you try other image files and post the image files here?\n\n```\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - macOS Sequoia (15.5.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M1 - Apple M1 (8 threads)\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3085271561/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3649100261","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108598#issuecomment-3649100261","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108598","id":3649100261,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ZgNnl","user":{"login":"Rudolph-B","id":52322745,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzIyNzQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52322745?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B","html_url":"https://github.com/Rudolph-B","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-13T08:08:02Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T08:08:02Z","bod